  "notes": [
    "Preserved compiler/lint diagnostics, a stale-dist capture after failed typecheck, and earlier successful checks superseded by final layout/source.",
    "Updated a test to await the lazy editor; corrected a testing-library option and bridge scope inference/missing-else lint. No assertion or lint was disabled.",
    "The labelled local card receives Tack\u2019s Build-prefix bui reference; corrected the tck-only test assumption.",
    "Axe caught duplicate Notes landmarks and a missing primary heading in expanded Notes. Visual review caught an island-only missing sr-only utility and native button styling; added scoped styles.",
    "The island harness explicitly permits one initial tack_sync_snapshot only in a marked expanded Notes scenario; all other command restrictions remain.",
    "The negative harness probe had a stale pre-V3 download-progress selector. It now waits for the current Nabbit heading before injecting the same console/network faults; all negative assertions pass.",
    "The attachment test initially attempted an upload with Nabbit\u2019s read-only client, which correctly rejected it. It now asserts that refusal and pulls a seeded existing Tack attachment over real HTTP.",
    "The first otherwise-complete flow reset its event counter on reload. Final flow verifies both pre-reload and post-reload event telemetry."
